    "## 3. 手算验证：HOG on 4×4 Patch\\n",
    "\\n",
    "### 示例：4×4 灰度图，2 个 bin\\n",
    "\\n",
    "$$I = \\\\begin{bmatrix} 10 & 20 \\\\\\\\ 30 & 50 \\\\end{bmatrix}$$\\n",
