    "（简化为 2×2 方便手算）\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**梯度计算（中心差分）：**\\n",
    "- $g_x(0,0) = I(1,0) - I(0,0) = 20 - 10 = 10$（右差分）\\n",
    "- $g_y(0,0) = I(0,1) - I(0,0) = 30 - 10 = 20$\\n",
    "- $g_x(1,0) = I(0,0) - I(1,0) = 10 - 20 = -10$（左差分）\\n",
    "- $g_y(1,0) = I(1,1) - I(1,0) = 50 - 20 = 30$\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**幅值和方向：**\\n",
    "- 像素(0,0)：$m = \\\\sqrt{100+400} = \\\\sqrt{500} \\\\approx 22.4$, $\\\\theta = \\\\text{atan2}(20, 10) \\\\approx 63.4°$\\n",
    "- 像素(1,0)：$m = \\\\sqrt{100+900} = \\\\sqrt{1000} \\\\approx 31.6$, $\\\\theta = \\\\text{atan2}(30, -10) \\\\approx 108.4°$\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**方向直方图（2 bins: [0°, 90°), [90°, 180°)）：**\\n",
    "- bin 0 [0-90°)：像素(0,0) 的 $\\\\theta=63.4°$ → 贡献幅值 22.4\\n",
    "- bin 1 [90-180°)：像素(1,0) 的 $\\\\theta=108.4°$ → 贡献幅值 31.6\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**归一化**（L2）：\\n",
    "- $norm = \\\\sqrt{22.4^2 + 31.6^2} = \\\\sqrt{501.8 + 998.6} = \\\\sqrt{1500.4} \\\\approx 38.7$\\n",
    "- 归一化后：$[22.4/38.7, 31.6/38.7] = [0.579, 0.817]$"
